    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My Company&quot; is a deep business simulation game where you start from scratch and build your own company in a virtual world. Experience the full journey from entrepreneurship, hiring staff, developing products, marketing, to expanding your business empire.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: You play as an entrepreneur aiming to build a leading company in a competitive market.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong>: As you make decisions and manage your company, you unlock new features and face greater challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goals</strong>: Achieve profitability, expand your market share, outcompete rivals, and become an industry giant.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges &amp; Mechanics</strong>: Face economic fluctuations, manage employees, adapt to changing customer demands, and test your business acumen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Mechanics</strong>: Includes financial management, product development, marketing, team building, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Each playthrough lasts about 10-20 hours, with high replayability and unique experiences every time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: Strategy, Simulation, Management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're new to business or a fan of simulation games, you'll find unique management fun in this game!</p>",
